Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Rebuilt guides, more offers and plain words, the STR
 refresh, small-phone fixes (part 4 of 4): v1.28 to v1.32 rebased on the
 election guides

Pages: cost to own, condos, rent prices, where to buy, Murrells Inlet (v1.28); the seven 2026-10-d guides (v1.31); North Myrtle Beach, Surfside Beach, buying in Myrtle Beach, which town, why Myrtle Beach (v1.32); more offers and plain words on the 20 guides of v1.24 to v1.28 (v1.30); the homes row search and the hub title on small phones (v1.29); the short-term rental figures refreshed sitewide (v1.28). Rebased on 257a5a6 (the election guides): the pages both sides changed are rebuilt from their specs with that commit's mkpage.js; llms.txt is merged; dates and llms-full.txt rebuilt. The roads-and-permits guide drops two keywords that other guides own (audit).
