-</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The direct answer</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">What it costs to own a home in Myrtle Beach</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Five lines decide it: the loan payment, property taxes, insurance, HOA dues, and upkeep. Two of them surprise almost everyone who moves here. Property tax on the same house is roughly three times higher when it is not your legal residence. Coastal insurance is often several policies, not one.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;">The calculator below adds all five, using the same Horry County tax math as our <a href="/buyers/property-taxes/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">property tax page</a>. It is planning math, not a quote.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="co-calc"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The calculator</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Your true monthly cost</h2><div style="max-width:680px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:1.5rem"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem"><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Purchase price ($)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coPrice" type="number" value="300000" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Down payment (%)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coDown" type="number" placeholder="Enter %" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Rate (%, from your lender&#39;s quote)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coRate" type="number" step="0.125" placeholder="Your rate" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Term (years)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coTerm" type="number" value="30" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Location</label><select class="idx-select" id="coLoc" onchange="coCalc()"><option value="254.6|83.4">City of Myrtle Beach</option><option value="221.2|0">North Myrtle Beach</option><option value="214.2|0">Surfside Beach</option><option value="272.5|0">Conway</option><option value="207.3|0">Murrells Inlet / Garden City</option><option value="201.0|0" selected>Unincorporated Horry (Carolina Forest, Socastee, Little River)</option></select></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">How you will own it</label><select class="idx-select" id="coStatus" onchange="coCalc()"><option value="4" selected>My legal residence (4%)</option><option value="6">Second home or rental (6%)</option></select></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Insurance ($/mo, your estimate)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coIns" type="number" value="160" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">HOA dues ($/mo)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coHoa" type="number" value="0" oninput="coCalc()"></div><div><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">Upkeep reserve (% of value / yr)</label><input class="idx-input" id="coMaint" type="number" step="0.25" value="1" oninput="coCalc()"></div></div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--navy);display:grid;gap:.35rem"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Loan payment (principal + interest)</span><strong id="coPI">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Property taxes</span><strong id="coTax">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Insurance</span><strong id="coInsOut">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>HOA dues</span><strong id="coHoaOut">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Upkeep reserve</span><strong id="coUp">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:.6rem;font-size:1.05rem"><span><strong>True monthly cost</strong></span><strong id="coTotal" style="color:var(--brass)">$0</strong></div></div><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Tax math mirrors our <a href="/buyers/property-taxes/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">property tax calculator</a>: Horry County&#39;s 2026 certified millage, the Act 388 school exemption on legal residences, and the Myrtle Beach TDF credit. It excludes the 65+ homestead exemption and small special districts. Insurance is your estimate; see <a href="/buyers/coastal-insurance/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">coastal insurance costs</a>. Example math for planning, not an offer or quote of credit. Your rate and terms come from your lender.</p></div><script>
