-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">How financing fits in</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Chapter3 works alongside an affiliated preferred lender, so your pre-approval, your offer, and your closing are handled by one team that talks to each other. For a first-time buyer that means fewer dropped balls, and straight answers on the tricky stuff, like whether a specific condo building is actually financeable, or how a condotel loan works, before you fall in love with a place you can't get a loan on. (See our Affiliated Business Arrangement disclosure in the footer for how that relationship works.)</p>
-</div></section>
-
