-<div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/">Buyers</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">New Construction</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Buying a new build on the Grand Strand</p><h1 class="detail-h1">New construction in Myrtle Beach:<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">the defect problem nobody advertises.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge, 30+ years on the Grand Strand &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 27, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">New construction is one of the Grand Strand&#39;s most active markets, and new does not mean worry-free. How to buy a new build with your own agent beside you.</p><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="#lead-form">Set up my builder tour</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div></div><section style="background:var(--navy)" id="lead-form"><div class="wrap" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Tour new construction with your own agent.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">Tell us the communities you are looking at. We register with you, review the contract and incentives, and set up the inspections.</p></div><div id="ldWrap" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ivory);border-radius:14px;padding:1.6rem;text-align:left"><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldCtx" placeholder="Community or builder (optional)"></div><div class="idx-lead"><input class="idx-input" id="ldName" placeholder="Your name"><input class="idx-input" id="ldPhone" placeholder="Phone" type="tel"></div><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldEmail" placeholder="Email" type="email"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:flex-start;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 .85rem;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="ldConsent" style="margin-top:.15rem;accent-color:var(--brass);flex-shrink:0;width:15px;height:15px"><span>I consent to receive calls and text messages from Chapter 3 Realty about my property inquiry, showing appointments, and listing information I requested, at the phone number provided, including calls placed using an automated system or an artificial or prerecorded voice. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help, STOP to opt out. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.</span></label><p id="ldErr" style="display:none;color:#a03333;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .7rem"></p><button class="btn btn-brass" style="width:100%" onclick="ldSubmit()">Set up my builder tour</button><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.7rem 0 0;line-height:1.5">Free, no obligation. We reach out the same day, evenings included. Prefer to talk now? <a href="tel:+18543332135" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding:.35rem .8rem;font-size:.8rem">Call 854.333.2135</a>.</p></div><div id="ldOk" style="display:none;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(244,239,232,.08);border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:14px;padding:1.4rem;color:var(--ivory);text-align:center;line-height:1.6">Thanks. A licensed agent will reach out the same day, evenings included, to set up your builder tour.</div><script>
