+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/relocating/">Relocating</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Which Town</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">13 places, from county records</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Which Grand Strand town fits you?<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">13 places near Myrtle Beach, compared.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 4, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">From Loris to Pawleys Island: where the sand is closest, where an acre is normal, where builders are selling, and what changes at the city line.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Where to live near Myrtle Beach depends on what you want most. Closest to the sand: Surfside Beach, Garden City and North Myrtle Beach. The most land: Aynor and Loris. The newest houses: Carolina Forest and Longs. The shortest drive to everything: Myrtle Beach and Socastee. The lowest prices: Conway, Loris, Longs and Socastee.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Pick the one or two things that matter most to you. The list below keeps only the places that have them.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Want a short list of towns that fit your budget?</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us build your shortlist</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="find-your-town"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Find your town">Which town near Myrtle Beach fits what you want?</h2><style id="c3-glass">main#main{--g-ink:#8a5226;--g-ink-lg:#a8612c;--g-edge:rgba(255,255,255,.8);--g-hi:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.95);--g-sh:0 1px 2px rgba(28,32,40,.05),0 14px 36px -20px rgba(28,32,40,.3);--g-r:20px;--g-blur:saturate(150%) blur(16px);background-color:#f8f4ee;background-image:radial-gradient(44rem 26rem at 4% 460px,rgba(232,201,154,.30),rgba(232,201,154,0) 70%),radial-gradient(40rem 26rem at 98% 1000px,rgba(196,120,58,.08),rgba(196,120,58,0) 70%),radial-gradient(46rem 26rem at 16% 1500px,rgba(232,201,154,.22),rgba(232,201,154,0) 70%),radial-gradient(40rem 24rem at 94% 1960px,rgba(42,48,64,.045),rgba(42,48,64,0) 70%);background-size:100% 2400px;background-repeat:repeat-y}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"],main#main .detail-hero{background:transparent!important}main#main .detail-hero{border-bottom:0}main#main .detail-hero.bg-grid{background-image:none}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]+section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7)}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]{padding-bottom:2.25rem}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]:not(.detail-hero+section){padding-top:2.25rem}@media (min-width:700px){main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]{padding-bottom:3.5rem}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]:not(.detail-hero+section){padding-top:3.5rem}}main#main .eyebrow,main#main p[style*="color:var(--brass)"]{color:var(--g-ink)!important}main#main .detail-h1 em{