+## North Myrtle Beach FAQ
 
-North Myrtle Beach, including communities like Cherry Grove and Ocean Drive, is known for a quieter, family oriented feel than the central strip while still drawing steady vacation-rental demand. Beach proximate inventory here tends toward established, well kept properties.
+### Is North Myrtle Beach part of Myrtle Beach?
+No. North Myrtle Beach is its own city in Horry County, South Carolina. Four beach towns joined to form it in 1968, and it has its own city tax and rental rules. The Myrtle Beach oceanfront is about 30 minutes south by car.
 
-Common Questions
