+## When is the best month to rent out a house in Myrtle Beach?
+Summer. Asking rents are about half a percent above the year's trend in August, the high, and about 1.4 percent below it in January, the low. A year's lease that starts in summer also ends in summer, so you look for the next tenant in the high months too.
