+## What is the fair market rent in Horry County?
+The fair market rent matters to a landlord who takes housing vouchers (Section 8). The U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) publishes it each year. For Horry County, it is $1,823 a month for three bedrooms in the fiscal year 2027 schedule, with utilities.
+It is not the average rent. About four in ten recent movers into a standard home pay that much or less.
