t a town: the county runs it, and most of its beach road is in Georgetown County, not Horry.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">For a condo on the sand, look at the ocean side by the pier. For a house with a dock, look at the marsh and the Georgetown end. For a house lived in all year, out of the high-risk flood zone, look west of Business 17.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us how you will use it. We send the Garden City homes that fit.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send me Garden City homes</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="where"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Where it is">Where is Garden City, SC, and which county is it in?</h2><style>
