.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0M2 20.5c1.7 1.2 3.3 1.2 5 0s3.3-1.2 5 0 3.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0"/></svg></span><span><strong>Fishing pier</strong><span class="t">668 feet</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5.5 21c.5-3 7.5-2.5 7.5-6.5S7.5 10.5 8 6.5M17.5 9.3V13"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="2.8"/><circle cx="8.2" cy="4" r="1.2"/></svg></span><span><strong>MarshWalk</strong><span class="t">8 min drive</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 10h4a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-4l-4 7H9l2-7H7l-2 2H3l2-4-2-4h2l2 2h4L9 3h3z"/></svg></span><span><strong>Airport</strong><span class="t">20 min drive</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 4, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Garden City is a beach community south of Myrtle Beach, with a fishing pier, houses on the marsh with docks, and quiet subdivisions inland.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Garden City, South Carolina is a beach community between Surfside Beach and Murrells Inlet. It is not a town: the county runs it, and most of its beach road is in Georgetown County, not Horry.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">For a condo on the sand, look at the ocean side by the pier. For a house with a dock, look at the marsh and the Georgetown end. For a house lived in all year, out of the high-risk flood zone, look west of Business 17.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us how you will use it. We send the Garden City homes that fit.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send me Garden City homes</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="where"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Where it is">Where is Garden City, SC, and which county is it in?</h2><style>
