></div><div class="c3-sb-halves"><p class="c3-sb-panel">South of the pier</p><div class="c3-sb-frame"><svg class="c3-sb-map" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 2341 2371" role="img" aria-labelledby="c3-sb-map-s"><title id="c3-sb-map-s">The south half of the town, from the south town line to the pier. Map of the Town of Surfside Beach, turned so the beach runs along the bottom. An orange band along the ocean marks the blocks where nightly rentals are allowed. A larger green area inland marks the streets where rentals under 30 days are not allowed. Gray areas are other districts. North of the pier the line between them follows Dogwood Drive North; south of the pier it follows Willow Drive South, then Lakeside Drive. US 17 Business runs along the inland edge. Ocean Lakes Family Campground, outside the town, is at the north end.</title><use href="#c3-sb-mapg"/><text x="1901" y="2083" text-anchor="end" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:135px;font-weight:700;fill:#1c2028;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:24px;stroke-linejoin:round;">Pier</text><text x="938" y="528" text-anchor="middle" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:125px;font-weight:700;fill:#1c2028;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:24px;stroke-linejoin:round;">US 17 Business</text><text x="637" y="1199" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-84.3 637 1199)" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:100px;font-weight:600;fill:#2a3040;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:24px;stroke-linejoin:round;">13th Ave S</text><text x="1612" y="1171" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-88.5 1612 1171)" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:100px;font-weight:600;fill:#2a3040;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:24px;stroke-linejoin:round;">6th Ave S</text><text x="995" y="1543" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(4.9 995 1543)" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size