+ *
+ * Batch 2026-11-a, Lane U. Version 1. The live page was hand-made with no spec; this spec replaces it.
+ * Reader, must-answers and plan: Blog-Brain batches/2026-11-a/invest-condos/ (must-answer.md, PLAN.md).
